I am afraid not. USB4RT is a project outside the Xenomai project, so you
would have to contact them to help you. Anyway, it should not be very
complicated, you simply have to try and understand how it works.

But this is probably the least of your problems, the bigger problem will
be to write a driver for labjack using USB4RT and the RTDM skin.

